WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:03,220
Makikawa brother

2
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:05,110
These people just scolded us and are now turning around

3
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:06,150
Let’s dig an igloo

4
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:07,910
Why are you so thick-skinned?

5
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:09,110
There is no core doorway

6
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:12,910
They can only learn a little bit, don't look at it and come over to help.

7
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:14,190
The house still needs to be repaired

8
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:16,300
There are many of us

9
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,180
See you next to that boy Makikawa

10
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:19,380
He chose a good location

11
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,180
Let's follow his example

12
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:23,820
Meet someone ten times older than him

13
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:24,980
Let him have it for a few days first

14
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:28,100
When we see the king, we will tear him to death with a long and bright look.

15
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,100
Digging bigger

16
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,140
Look

17
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:32,540
The door of that boy Makikawa

18
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,660
Why did it open inwards?

19
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:34,940
The house we usually live in

20
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,740
Don't doors always push outwards? It doesn't matter whether they go in or out.

21
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:38,340
As long as the door can let people in, it's not like his

22
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:39,460
Mouse holes

23
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:41,940
You have to crawl on the ground to get in and out. Isn’t that shameful for our family?

24
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,540
You need to dig more generously.

25
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,740
This is what a house looks like, right?

26
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:47,060
Let's dig the door bigger and higher.

27
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,420
People can enter and exit with their waist straight

28
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:49,580
How bright

29
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:52,020
This is what we call Brother Muchuan and his family.

30
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,180
I'm telling you about the righteousness method.
